{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-08_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-08","title":"Acute Stress Disorder","storyCode":"4-8","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"11ef99a2758c954b15440207e756c33f1f598aaacd7751b5587869cc66ce9602","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Frostleaf leads the way, helping the team find Meteorite and Jessica. However, Jessica seems to be traumatized by something she saw.\nUnder Amiya's guidance, she is able to gradually leave the terror behind her.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I know it's you behind there. Hold your fire."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Look who I brought."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite, it's us!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Who? Is that.. Amiya?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! Amiya, you really came!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"It's so good to see you..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...but you shouldn't have come. This whole thing is one big trap."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"It wasn't worth it for you to come to our rescue."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"This was the wrong decision...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"There's no point in blaming her now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Besides, even if everyone else doesn't think you can be rescued, Amiya would still not give up on you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"I wasn't blaming her! It's just that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Tsk. Sorry, Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's okay. I'm just glad to see that you're all still safe."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But... what happened to Jessica?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"She's... still in shock."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Originally, I wanted to wait for her to get better, but..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"It seems like she's been... traumatized."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Jessica, are you okay?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"This is all I can do..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf, do me a favor. Place her hands on my arm, and hold her fingers tight."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...Sure thing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Good."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...!!"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ngh..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya!"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I'm fine! It's just... Nnh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Such deep sorrow..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's a bit vague, but..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Jessica!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"You have to be strong, Jessica...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...Amiya...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya... Amiya..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"There, there... Everything will be okay."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Jessica... Are you alright...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya... What was I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm so sorry... I didn't think... I didn't think that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Those, those... Auugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I know what it's like."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, I've also experienced it..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Wanting to run, but your legs not moving..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Wanting to scream, but your voice not coming out..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand what you've been through, Jessica... I've been there too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Try standing up."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You don't need to be afraid anymore..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Because we're all together now. You're not alone. We'll always be there for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's go back to Rhodes Island together."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka and Liskarm are waiting for you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...Mhm!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya... You... what did you do just now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Shh... Keep it a secret from Dr. Kal'tsit."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["Frostleaf"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["Meteorite"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["Jessica"]}]}
